{
  "$schema": "./tokens.schema.json",
  "typeface": [
    {
      "token": "--dsw-font-family",
      "claude": "'Anthropic Sans Web Text','DeepCraft Inter','Noto Sans SC','Source Han Sans SC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"
    },
    {
      "token": "--dsh-deepcraft-font-serif",
      "claude": "'Anthropic Serif Web Text','DeepCraft Noto Serif',Georgia,'Times New Roman','Noto Sans SC','Source Han Sans SC','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif",
      "host": "var(--dsw-font-family)"
    },
    {
      "token": "--dsh-deepcraft-font-prose",
      "claude": "'Anthropic Serif Web Text','DeepCraft Noto Serif',Georgia,'Times New Roman','Noto Sans SC','Source Han Sans SC','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif",
      "host": "var(--dsw-font-family)",
      "note": "Conversation prose: Claude sets Latin text in the serif face and lets Chinese fall through to a sans CJK — the serif Latin faces carry no CJK glyphs, so the stack leads with serif and names the sans CJK families after it. The interface keeps the sans stack; only Markdown prose uses this."
    },
    {
      "token": "--dsh-deepcraft-font-code",
      "claude": "'Anthropic Mono Web','JetBrains Mono','Noto Sans SC','Source Han Sans SC','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',ui-monospace,'SF Mono','Fira Code',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,Courier,monospace",
      "host": "var(--ds-font-family-code)"
    },
    {
      "token": "--dsh-deepcraft-font-brand",
      "claude": "'Anthropic Serif Web Text', var(--dsh-deepcraft-font-serif)",
      "host": "var(--dsw-font-family)",
      "note": "Claude's lockup is drawn in Anthropic's serif, so its rows take the same face; the serif token stays behind it so a missing font degrades to the shipped serif."
    },
    {
      "token": "--dsw-font-markdown-h2",
      "claude": "700 calc(18px + var(--dsh-content-font-delta)) / calc(26px + var(--dsh-content-font-delta)) var(--dsh-deepcraft-font-prose)",
      "note": "The host reads these through a `font:` shorthand that names --dsw-font-family directly, so overriding the `-font-family` sub-tokens never reached the page: the shorthand itself has to be re-declared."
    },
    {
      "token": "--dsw-font-markdown-h3",
      "claude": "700 calc(16px + var(--dsh-content-font-delta)) / calc(24px + var(--dsh-content-font-delta)) var(--dsh-deepcraft-font-prose)"
    }
  ],
